  ('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000066', 'f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007', '58aeea98-85ee-4405-9225-57a9bf025aec', 'e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000128', '[Q128] A solid sphere and a hollow sphere of equal mass and radius roll down an inclined plane without slipping. The ratio of their accelerations is:', 'MCQ', 4, 0, '[{"key":"A","text":"$\\frac{25}{21}$"},{"key":"B","text":"$\\frac{21}{25}$"},{"key":"C","text":"$\\frac{15}{14}$"},{"key":"D","text":"$\\frac{14}{15}$"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"A","key":"A"}'::jsonb, NULL),
  ('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000067', 'f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007', '58aeea98-85ee-4405-9225-57a9bf025aec', 'e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000131', '[Q131] The magnetic flux linked with a coil varies with time as $\Phi = 4t^3 - 2t + 5$ Wb. The magnitude of induced EMF at $t = 2$ s is:', 'MCQ', 4, 0, '[{"key":"A","text":"$48$ V"},{"key":"B","text":"$46$ V"},{"key":"C","text":"$50$ V"},{"key":"D","text":"$44$ V"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"B","key":"B"}'::jsonb, NULL),
  ('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000068', 'f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007', '58aeea98-85ee-4405-9225-57a9bf025aec', 'e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000134', '[Q134] The de Broglie wavelength of an electron accelerated through a potential difference of $100$ V is approximately:', 'MCQ', 4, 0, '[{"key":"A","text":"$1.23$ nm"},{"key":"B","text":"$0.012$ nm"},{"key":"C","text":"$0.123$ nm"},{"key":"D","text":"$12.3$ nm"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"C","key":"C"}'::jsonb, NULL),
  ('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000069', 'f0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007', '58aeea98-85ee-4405-9225-57a9bf025aec', 'e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000137', '[Q137] The electric potential at a distance $r$ from an electric dipole on its axial line varies as:', 'MCQ', 4, 0, '[{"key":"A","text":"$\\frac{1}{r}$"},{"key":"B","text":"$\\frac{1}{r^3}$"},{"key":"C","text":"$r^2$"},{"key":"D","text":"$\\frac{1}{r^2}$"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"D","key":"D"}'::jsonb, NULL),
